{"type":"Film","id":"DE2016_023","slug":"de2016-023-als-wir-die-zukunft-waren","title":{"native":"Als wir die Zukunft waren","english":""},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-02-25","year":2016},"filmType":"Documentary","directors":[{"id":"Lars Barthel","slug":"lars-barthel","name":"Lars Barthel","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},{"id":"Gabriele Denecke","slug":"gabriele-denecke","name":"Gabriele Denecke","birthYear":1952,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},{"id":"Peter Kahane","slug":"peter-kahane","name":"Peter Kahane","birthYear":1949,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},{"id":"Thomas Knauf","slug":"thomas-knauf","name":"Thomas Knauf","birthYear":1951,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},{"id":"Ralf Marschalleck","slug":"ralf-marschalleck","name":"Ralf Marschalleck","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},{"id":"Hannes Schönemann","slug":"hannes-schonemann","name":"Hannes Schönemann","birthYear":1946,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},{"id":"Andreas Voigt","slug":"andreas-voigt","name":"Andreas Voigt","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]}],"genre":["Documentary – Participatory mode","Anthology Films"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt5752508/mediaviewer/rm2698318080/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JekhXVncPiM&ab_channel=kinofilme"},"synopsis":{"native":"Dokumentarischer Episodenfilm, in dem sieben Filmemacher aus der ehemaligen DDR ihre eigenen Kindheits- und Jugenderinnerungen Revue passieren lassen. Zu ihnen gehören Lars Barthel, Andreas Voigt, Gabriele Denecke, Peter Kahane, Hannes Schönemann, Thomas Knauf und Ralf Marschalleck, die allesamt die Filmhochschule in Potsdam-Babelsberg besucht und gemeinsam für die DEFA-Studios gearbeitet haben. Mit der Schilderung ihrer persönlichen Erfahrungen und Erinnerungen, die je nach familiärem Hintergrund und der damit einhergegangenen individuellen Haltung zum System sehr unterschiedlich eingefärbt sind, vermitteln sie einen hautnahen und persönlichen Eindruck vom ambivalenten Lebensgefühl junger Menschen im Ostdeutschland der 50er und 60er Jahre, das zwischen kindlicher Neugier, Wohlbehagen, Aufbegehren und Unterdrückung schwankte.","english":"Having failed his law school entrance exam, almost by chance, Elias (20) takes a job in a care centre for adolescents. Here he will quickly be confronted by an environment he doesn’t understand, and events that will impact his life profoundly."},"production":[{"country":"Germany","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Andreas Voigt","slug":"andreas-voigt","name":"Andreas Voigt","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Gabriele Denecke","slug":"gabriele-denecke","name":"Gabriele Denecke","birthYear":1952,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Hannes Schönemann","slug":"hannes-schonemann","name":"Hannes Schönemann","birthYear":1946,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Lars Barthel","slug":"lars-barthel","name":"Lars Barthel","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Peter Kahane","slug":"peter-kahane","name":"Peter Kahane","birthYear":1949,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Ralf Marschalleck","slug":"ralf-marschalleck","name":"Ralf Marscha